# The rendered page and its lookup bank (29 MB between them). They are
# published to the `site` branch by .github/publish-site.sh, which force-
# adds web/ from the working tree, and the site serves that branch — so
# they must never be committed to main (17 Oct). Ignoring them is what
# finally makes `git add -A web/...` in a workflow incapable of putting
# them back; two jobs were still doing it on 21 Oct.
web/index.html
web/matchbank.json
